<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Judd Cyber Consulting Group | Technology Risk & Cyber Advisory</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary-dark: #0f172a;
            --secondary-dark: #1e293b;
            --accent-blue: #2563eb;
            --accent-cyan: #0284c7;
            --text-light: #f8fafc;
            --text-muted: #94a3b8;
            --text-dark: #334155;
            --bg-light: #f8fafc;
            --card-border: #e2e8f0;
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-light);
            color: var(--text-dark);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        header {
            background: var(--primary-dark);
            color: var(--text-light);
            padding: 1.25rem 8%;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--accent-blue);
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            color: var(--text-light);
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .logo span {
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
        }

        nav a {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            text-decoration: none;
            margin-left: 2rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: color 0.2s ease;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: var(--text-light);
        }

        .hero {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary-dark) 0%, var(--secondary-dark) 100%);
            color: var(--text-light);
            padding: 6rem 8% 7rem; /* Added padding since button is removed */
            text-align: center;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 3rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        }

        .hero h1 span {
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            max-width: 720px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .services {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
            padding: 5rem 8%;
            margin-top: -2rem;
        }

        .card {
            background: white;
            padding: 2.25rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 15px -3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
            transition: transform 0.2s ease;
        }

        .card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-4px);
        }

        .card-tag {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: var(--accent-blue);
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            display: block;
        }

        .card h3 {
            color: var(--primary-dark);
            font-size: 1.35rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
        }

        .card p {
            color: #64748b;
            font-size: 0.975rem;
        }

        footer {
            background: var(--primary-dark);
            color: var(--text-muted);
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2.5rem 8%;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--secondary-dark);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <div class="logo">JUDD CYBER <span>CONSULTING GROUP</span></div>
        <nav>
            <a href="#services">Capabilities</a>
            <a href="#architecture">Architecture</a>
            <a href="#compliance">IT Audit</a>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <section class="hero">
        <h1>Technology Risk & <span>Cyber Advisory</span></h1>
        <p>Bridging the gap between complex IT infrastructure, database security, and enterprise risk management through structured audits and technical execution.</p>
        <!-- GitHub Button Removed -->
    </section>

    <section class="services" id="services">
        <div class="card">
            <span class="card-tag">IT General Controls</span>
            <h3>Technology Risk Assurance</h3>
            <p>Evaluating enterprise IT general controls (ITGCs), user access management, segregation of duties (SoD), and change management controls across enterprise systems.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <span class="card-tag">Data Architecture</span>
            <h3>Database Engineering & SQL</h3>
            <p>Designing normalized 3NF relational schemas, constructing ERD diagrams, and authoring complex SQL scripts for multi-table analytical queries.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <span class="card-tag">Systems Analysis</span>
            <h3>Enterprise Architecture</h3>
            <p>Mapping supply chain logistics, defining non-profit stakeholder functional requirements, and deploying custom web architectures.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 Judd Cyber Consulting Group. CIS Portfolio Front-End Artifact.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
